{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\",\n    \"This is the author/funder, who has granted medRxiv a license to display the preprint in perpetuity.\",\n    \"The copyright holder for this version posted February 15, 2022. https://doi.org/10.1101/2022.02.08.22270370 doi: medRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\",\n    \"The copyright holder for this version posted February 15, 2022. https://doi.org/10.1101/2022.02.08.22270370 doi: medRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文明确将所提供的论文版本标记为 medRxiv 预印本，并明确声明该预印本尚未经过同行评审，因此报告的说法有直接、明确的全文依据，判定为 yes。但全文没有出现 Science Translational Medicine 的期刊名称、正式发表记录、期刊卷期页码或同行评审完成的信息。因此，指控者关于该研究后来于2022年正式发表于 Science Translational Medicine 的说法，无法仅凭这份全文确认，判定为 cannot_tell，而不是 no。需要区分的是，2022年2月发布未经同行评审的预印本，并不排除同一研究后来经过同行评审并正式发表于期刊。报告对所提供版本的标记有依据，但全文不足以判断该研究是否另有正式发表版本。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "568ecd5b-dfbd-4c80-b870-f9eccda5d9e0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104808198477Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:48:43.620190+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2144c0ff36cfeb096f88794024da986ece4e322c190777419959ff58fa585968", "attachmen